<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's money rates close at high level.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's money rates close at high level.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan money market rates closed at a high level on Thursday in a volatile interbank market before Friday's religious holiday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The day started with overnight bids and offers at 18 and 18.95 percent respectively, a dealer at KASB &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>The market closed with deals at declining levels of 17.50, 16.75 and 15 percent, he said. Some four-day funds were dealt around 15 percent.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
